{"parentUuid":"9b422a92-19d5-4a72-b7c0-d7b154539584","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfPME1EYKdpUgy13fqmhF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JWDkj9UYYWuCvxpLEFC53k","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/handoffs/2026-09-24-mac-evening-split.md","content":"# 2026-09-24 — Mac half of the day/evening machine split\n\n## What and why\nWindows is now the daytime machine and the Mac the evening one (decided on Windows earlier\ntoday, see STATUS.md). The Windows session could not change the Mac's launchd jobs; its Mac\nattempt was blocked by permission settings. This Mac session ran `/dev-sync`, then did the Mac half.\n\n## Done\n- `/dev-sync` (Mac): dotclaude pulled 8 commits, global-memory pulled 8 commits\n  (newest `fe55b9c`), skills already current. global-memory transcript conflicts in\n  `transcripts/2026-09-23.md` and `2026-09-24.md` resolved by keeping both sides (log files).\n  Memory mirror: no changes. 142 repos clean after sync. `RunningTheRoom` cloned (new from Windows).\n- `com.keystone.rituals`: `launchctl bootout` + `launchctl disable` (persists across reboot).\n- `com.keystone.dailybackup`: `StartCalendarInterval.Hour` 9 -> 21, reloaded. First run at the\n  new time started 21:12 and pushed global-memory, which clears the 9/23 and 9/24\n  `repo-behind-blocked:global-memory` errors.\n\n## Files changed\n- `~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.keystone.dailybackup.plist` (Hour 21)\n- `~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.keystone.dailybackup.plist.bak-2026-09-24` (old copy, Hour 9)\n- `~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/STATUS.md`\n- `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/2026-09-23.md`, `2026-09-24.md` (merge)\n\n## Next\n1. Windows: confirm the `KeystoneOS-Rituals` scheduled task is enabled.\n2. Add `RunningTheRoom` to `backup-manifest.json` (daily-backup log: \"1 unmanaged DEV dir\").\n3. Memory compiler backlog (3 logs): run `compile.py` by hand.\n\n## Gotchas\n- `~/.claude/scripts/daily-backup.ps1` line 2 comment still says \"00:30\"; the plist is the truth (21:00).\n- `dcg` blocks `git -C $var` inside loops; use literal paths.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_read_input_tokens":119564,"output_tokens":1253,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":317},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":907,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1253,"cache_read_input_tokens":119564,"cache_creation_input_tokens":907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":907},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01JWDkj9UYYWuCvxpLEFC53k":{"file_path":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/handoffs/2026-09-24-mac-evening-split.md","content":"# 2026-09-24 — Mac half of the day/evening machine split\n\n## What and why\nWindows is now the daytime machine and the Mac the evening one (decided on Windows earlier\ntoday, see STATUS.md). The Windows session could not change the Mac's launchd jobs; its Mac\nattempt was blocked by permission settings. This Mac session ran `/dev-sync`, then did the Mac half.\n\n## Done\n- `/dev-sync` (Mac): dotclaude pulled 8 commits, global-memory pulled 8 commits\n  (newest `fe55b9c`), skills already current. global-memory transcript conflicts in\n  `transcripts/2026-09-23.md` and `2026-09-24.md` resolved by keeping both sides (log files).\n  Memory mirror: no changes. 142 repos clean after sync. `RunningTheRoom` cloned (new from Windows).\n- `com.keystone.rituals`: `launchctl bootout` + `launchctl disable` (persists across reboot).\n- `com.keystone.dailybackup`: `StartCalendarInterval.Hour` 9 -> 21, reloaded. First run at the\n  new time started 21:12 and pushed global-memory, which clears the 9/23 and 9/24\n  `repo-behind-blocked:global-memory` errors.\n\n## Files changed\n- `~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.keystone.dailybackup.plist` (Hour 21)\n- `~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.keystone.dailybackup.plist.bak-2026-09-24` (old copy, Hour 9)\n- `~/DEV/KeystoneOS/docs/STATUS.md`\n- `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/2026-09-23.md`, `2026-09-24.md` (merge)\n\n## Next\n1. Windows: confirm the `KeystoneOS-Rituals` scheduled task is enabled.\n2. Add `RunningTheRoom` to `backup-manifest.json` (daily-backup log: \"1 unmanaged DEV dir\").\n3. Memory compiler backlog (3 logs): run `compile.py` by hand.\n\n## Gotchas\n- `~/.claude/scripts/daily-backup.ps1` line 2 comment still says \"00:30\"; the plist is the truth (21:00).\n- `dcg` blocks `git -C $var` inside loops; use literal paths.\n"}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CfPMDzDHBvD1GmpyaCBfF","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"6ba08970-9f77-4433-acae-7180183d6b5f","timestamp":"2026-09-25T02:13:53.524Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"51d890bb-1aa4-4397-9981-be25e2430651","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/KeystoneOS","sessionId":"51d890bb-1aa4-4397-9981-be25e2430651","version":"2.1.281","gitBranch":"main"}
